WEBVTT

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:16.820
This is bad...

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:18.270
We're too far from the

00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:19.670
footholds leading to the fortress.

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:23.830
But I have to get the 
princess somewhere safe...

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:26.610
Princess! Princess!

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:28.930
Hero!

00:00:28.930 --> 00:00:29.920
That voice...

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:32.170
Rico? Eclair?

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:34.680
Sorry we're late, Princess!

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:37.140
We're here now!

00:02:19.130 --> 00:02:22.830
Like a Flower Floating in the Night Sky

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:25.340
Eclair, I'm glad you're alright!

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:26.810
Of course I am.

00:02:26.810 --> 00:02:28.370
I told you I'd be right back.

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:30.160
Rico... It's really you...

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:31.460
Yes, Princess!

00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:33.710
I was on my way here

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:38.300
...so I caught her and now here we are!

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:40.520
She told me that our Princess and hero

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:41.800
were in trouble, so...

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:43.300
I see!

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:45.300
Harlan! We're almost there!

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:46.810
Don't give up!

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:05.160
Well, our Princess and hero 
certainly surprised us...

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:07.430
...to be able to defeat a demon

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:13.130
I knew they could do it...

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:15.750
Both the Princess and Sink

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:18.460
are actually pretty capable...

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:21.720
You're right... well now...

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:24.470
...we'll take over from here!

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:25.800
Yes!

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:39.190
It is our duty to defeat enemy swords

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:45.050
Across the land... over 
thousands of miles...

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:49.490
...fighting for our world 
for hundreds of years.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:53.200
Land god of the foxes, Yukikaze and

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.040
the demon slaying swordfighter, Dalkian!

00:03:58.300 --> 00:04:01.880
All the demons we've 
defeated in our journey...

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:04.890
...amount to five hundred and nine!

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:11.390
Demons will not flourish in our world!

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:18.520
Die, you evil beings!

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:23.530
Holy Fox Fangs

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:25.780
Seal and Destroy Demon

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:57.310
Hmm... were we successful?

00:04:57.530 --> 00:04:59.400
Yes, Oyakata-sama!

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:02.320
The demon is securely 
sealed in the seal sword.

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:05.700
Good.

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:12.670
We must report this to the Princess
at the fortress...

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:15.370
Yes! I'll go!

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:17.880
Good.

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:22.510
Everyone, if you want to 
come along, follow me!

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:30.640
So you see...

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:33.670
this child's mother asked for my help

00:05:36.070 --> 00:05:39.610
Excelede and Palladion lent
us their power

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:40.820
and now here we are...

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:42.020
I see.

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:43.530
So that's what happened...

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:47.890
Princess! I must say again,

00:05:47.890 --> 00:05:49.540
you did wonderfully!

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:50.750
Many demons are unfortunate

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:52.700
beings that were cursed...

00:05:52.960 --> 00:05:56.020
Not only did you defeat it...

00:05:58.450 --> 00:06:01.350
Oh, I couldn't have done it alone...

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:04.460
...it was all thanks 
to Sink and Leo-sama.

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:07.260
Hero, you were brilliant, too!

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:11.630
Thanks...

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:18.650
Um, Yukikaze... this 
child's mother, is she...?

00:06:19.910 --> 00:06:23.030
The mother you met, Princess...

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:26.570
...she was trapped inside the 
blood and meat of the demon,

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:30.860
but her love for her child 
allowed her to stay connected...

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:33.480
...so when the demon's body died,

00:06:33.480 --> 00:06:35.310
and the child was saved...

00:06:35.310 --> 00:06:38.870
the mother's soul has 
probably gone to heaven...

00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:41.210
I see...

00:06:43.050 --> 00:06:47.800
Princess! May I look after this child?

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:49.110
Oh, yes!

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:52.260
I would like to care for him

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:54.390
at my home until he is better...

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:56.140
Yes, please!

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:58.390
And then there's Leo-sama...

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:02.070
I hope her injuries 
aren't too serious...

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:03.320
Yes...

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.010
The defensive troops at the fortress

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:11.340
It looks like there were some injured

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:16.530
The fight with the demon 
was broadcast to everyone,

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:20.640
The people of both countries are worried

00:07:25.900 --> 00:07:27.000
I see...

00:07:28.890 --> 00:07:31.590
Open the hall and call the press.

00:07:33.310 --> 00:07:34.900
Uh, yes!

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:38.120
A special broadcast was made

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:40.080
for all the worried people

00:07:42.820 --> 00:07:45.800
In it Leo-sama apologized...
and announced

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:48.730
that the battles for the 
day will be canceled...

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:50.850
The reason for the cancellation

00:07:50.850 --> 00:07:53.210
was that a gigantic demon had appeared

00:07:53.210 --> 00:07:55.530
and left injured soldiers 
in it's wake...

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:58.220
...and that it was 
necessary to investigate

00:07:58.220 --> 00:08:00.290
why the demon appeared 
and to ensure safety.

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:03.420
We do not yet know why 
the demon appeared...

00:08:06.760 --> 00:08:08.610
I may have been punished by the gods

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:10.260
for saying we should 
wager our countries'

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:11.590
treasured swords on this battle...

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:15.180
I apologize for having 
to end the big battle

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:23.350
I am truly sorry as the promoter...

00:08:24.780 --> 00:08:26.400
To ensure nothing like 
this happens again,

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:28.860
we will plan a fun battle 
in the near future...

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:33.240
Of course, we will discuss things 
with the Biscotti side first...

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:40.120
Through this incident,
I vow to try harder as your leader...

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:42.580
I know I am still lacking...

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:44.370
Everyone of Galette...

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:47.360
Will you still follow me?

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:53.890
Everyone in Biscotti,
will you still participate in my battles?

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:01.350
Thank you! Thank you!

00:09:05.900 --> 00:09:07.990
Leo-sama gave her apologies...

00:09:10.170 --> 00:09:12.280
...and that evening...

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:15.230
...in order to make up 
for the cancelled battle,

00:09:15.760 --> 00:09:19.670
it was decided that the Princess 
would give a special concert.

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:28.180
First, please move here like 
it says in the schedule.

00:09:28.180 --> 00:09:29.020
Yes.

00:09:29.020 --> 00:09:29.840
Hero...

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:35.030
Thank you...

00:09:35.030 --> 00:09:37.760
If it weren't for you things 
would be so much worse.

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:39.870
Oh, but I'm sorry...

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:42.010
I allowed Eclair to get hurt.

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:44.660
No, she's a knight after all.

00:09:46.860 --> 00:09:49.300
...it's more like she injured her honor.

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:52.900
But I thought that Flonyald 
was a peaceful world...

00:09:53.490 --> 00:09:55.720
I didn't think you had demons like that.

00:09:55.720 --> 00:09:56.810
Yeah...

00:09:58.030 --> 00:10:01.200
It was the first time I 
ever saw one so big...

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:05.480
Once you leave the protected areas,

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:07.280
there are dangers...

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:10.170
...and the battles we 
have all the time...

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:12.840
...they're to remind us of that

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:14.810
danger and keep us from

00:10:14.810 --> 00:10:16.290
forgetting how to fight.

00:10:16.770 --> 00:10:17.680
I see...

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:21.180
It is not a good thing to 
use power to hurt others...

00:10:21.560 --> 00:10:24.290
...but if we hesitate and do not fight,

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:26.980
we cannot protect the 
things we hold dear.

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:29.190
Of course.

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:30.360
Brother!

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:34.570
Sorry to interrupt your talk...

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:36.080
the staff members would like

00:10:36.080 --> 00:10:37.700
to discuss the onsite security...

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:39.120
Right...

00:10:39.830 --> 00:10:42.700
Well then... We'll 
take more later, Hero.

00:10:43.970 --> 00:10:45.330
Uh, yes!

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:51.960
Eclair...

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:54.920
Should you be moving around?

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:57.010
It's no problem.

00:10:59.140 --> 00:11:02.890
Anyway... have you eaten already?

00:11:03.620 --> 00:11:04.930
No. Not yet.

00:11:04.980 --> 00:11:07.060
There are some food vendors over there.

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:08.310
Do you want to get something to eat?

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:10.810
Oh, sounds good!
Let's go, let's go!

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:16.700
This is certainly getting interesting!

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:19.070
Indeed!

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:26.500
Here.

00:11:27.610 --> 00:11:28.580
Thanks.

00:11:29.740 --> 00:11:30.690
What's this?

00:11:30.690 --> 00:11:34.470
Coconapukka, it's easy 
to eat and nutritious...

00:11:34.800 --> 00:11:38.210
Really? Thanks!

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:49.650
Oh, to think that Eclair 
would ask a boy on a date...

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:56.820
The mood is pretty good, too!

00:11:58.750 --> 00:12:01.200
There's something I need to say to you.

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:07.120
I was not able to rescue 
the Princess on my own...

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:12.330
As the Captain of the Royal 
Guard of the Biscotti Knights,

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:14.460
I have great respect for 
your courage and skills.

00:12:15.270 --> 00:12:17.670
I am honored, Captain!

00:12:24.450 --> 00:12:26.560
But I think, if you were 
on your own, Eclair,

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:29.440
you would have found a 
way to do it on your own.

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:34.180
You have been protecting 
the Princess for much

00:12:34.180 --> 00:12:35.650
longer than I have, after all.

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:41.150
Yes! That's it! Just a little bit...

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:44.460
Closer!

00:12:47.670 --> 00:12:48.870
Hi!

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:51.660
What are you two doing here?

00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:54.160
Hey.

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:56.170
Sink, Droopy ears!

00:12:57.270 --> 00:12:58.150
Prince Gaul!

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:06.280
But really, you guys did a great job!

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:09.490
Well a lot happened...

00:13:09.490 --> 00:13:11.000
And you know, after everything

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:13.000
that happened with the demon 
and then the broadcast...

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:15.290
...it's like whatever was bothering 
my sister has gone away,

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:19.890
I haven't heard the details yet...

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:23.280
I see.

00:13:23.610 --> 00:13:26.780
Oh and I heard from 
Bernard that the battle

00:13:26.780 --> 00:13:30.130
events will return to 
the regular schedule.

00:13:30.130 --> 00:13:31.540
That's good to know!

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:35.200
So, the battle is over and 
everything is all cleared up...

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:37.290
...the demon has been defeated...

00:13:37.810 --> 00:13:39.750
...and things are peaceful again

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:42.550
for the Biscotti and Galette.

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:45.090
I sure hope so.

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:46.590
Indeed!

00:13:46.810 --> 00:13:49.290
The battle was cancelled 
part way through,

00:13:52.070 --> 00:13:54.600
Really... I'm glad too!

00:13:58.110 --> 00:14:00.780
Hmm? Is it a letter?

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:05.650
Let me see...

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:12.160
Rico. What's wrong?

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:14.630
Umm, the Academy wants me to

00:14:14.630 --> 00:14:17.160
contact them... it's urgent...

00:14:17.300 --> 00:14:18.420
Oh my...

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:20.920
Hero, Prince Gaul...

00:14:24.470 --> 00:14:26.370
-Okay!
-Sure, do your thing!

00:14:28.110 --> 00:14:30.990
The stage is almost ready.

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:33.260
Excuse me, Princess!

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:43.630
Leo-sama!

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:50.370
Sorry to bother you...

00:14:50.370 --> 00:14:51.530
Not at all...

00:14:52.850 --> 00:14:55.210
I have to apologize for 
everything that happened...

00:14:56.170 --> 00:14:57.710
Oh no, that's not...

00:14:58.300 --> 00:15:00.990
I put you in danger...

00:15:00.990 --> 00:15:03.230
and messed up the battles...

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:05.710
I will apologize formally for this...

00:15:07.610 --> 00:15:11.260
And I put you through so much...
the past six months...

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:14.970
Oh no, I learned a lot 
of important things...

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:17.430
...as leader of this country during the

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:19.480
days of battle and this incident.

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:22.440
The importance of being prepared 
for battle and dangers...

00:15:23.780 --> 00:15:26.480
it is to protect and lead my people...

00:15:26.710 --> 00:15:28.420
It is because of

00:15:28.420 --> 00:15:32.300
you that I realized I 
must be a better ruler...

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:35.330
I vowed deep in my heart...

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:39.500
So thank you, Leo-sama.

00:15:41.130 --> 00:15:45.120
And I understand everything you did

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:47.620
was in order to protect me...

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:49.670
Wait... who told you?

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:51.880
Violle and Rouge...

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:53.860
Those stupid...

00:15:53.860 --> 00:15:56.470
Oh please don't scold them!

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:00.920
Oh why!

00:16:00.920 --> 00:16:03.810
I called you out before your performance

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:09.300
I... I'm sorry!

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:16.050
But when I found out, I was so happy...

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:22.960
The future is determined 
by your own hand...

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:25.730
It is foolish to allow fortunes and

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:27.410
star readings to affect you...

00:16:29.750 --> 00:16:31.470
My feelings haven't changed.

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:34.310
But then... you were so worried 
about the star readings,

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:39.440
...and you tried to protect me...

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:41.890
You see, I was...

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:47.620
The little Millefi that always 
needed your protection...

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:54.000
I have subjects and 
friends that I trust...

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:58.960
You do not need to put your life at risk

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:03.830
No... you don't understand!

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:07.110
Ever since we were little,
you watched

00:17:07.110 --> 00:17:09.130
over me and loved me...

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:12.280
The kindness you showed me...

00:17:15.050 --> 00:17:16.850
If anything were to 
ever happen to you...

00:17:21.090 --> 00:17:23.690
I'm sorry, Leo-sama...

00:17:29.640 --> 00:17:33.490
Leo-sama, you are a great ruler...

00:17:34.980 --> 00:17:38.860
We should have taken more care...

00:17:38.860 --> 00:17:39.740
Yes...

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:43.640
Leader of the Knights,
you must keep

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:46.000
in closer contact with 
General Bernard...

00:17:46.200 --> 00:17:48.320
Yes, I would appreciate it

00:17:48.320 --> 00:17:50.000
if you would assist us...

00:17:50.350 --> 00:17:51.210
Yes...

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:56.340
It's been a while since I 
embarrassed myself like this...

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:58.670
There's nothing to be 
embarrassed about...

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:00.760
Princess?

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:04.270
I'm sorry but it's almost 
time for your rehearsal.

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:06.760
I'm sorry. I took up 
too much of your time.

00:18:06.760 --> 00:18:07.770
Oh, not at all!

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:10.450
It's been a while since 
I heard you sing...

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:16.590
Of course not! I will do my best!

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:08.410
<i>Through the sparkling light and wind</i>

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:14.460
<i>I run far beyond the blue sky with you</i>

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:19.510
<i>Hold my hand tightly
And don't leave my hand</i>

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:24.830
<i>I say I love you
To tell you how I feel</i>

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:30.050
<i>Whenever we misunderstand each other</i>

00:19:30.880 --> 00:19:35.690
<i>Whenever we can't touch our hearts</i>

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:41.220
<i>Whenever we get lost and tremble</i>

00:19:41.220 --> 00:19:43.490
<i>I will...</i>

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:52.670
<i>...go ahead with a little courage and
hope in my heart</i>

00:19:52.670 --> 00:20:00.970
<i>I will always show you my
overwhelming feeling with my words</i>

00:20:01.250 --> 00:20:08.130
<i>I love you
I hope my words touch your heart</i>

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:34.290
<i>It is a miracle that we met each other</i>

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:39.350
<i>
And the miracle tied us together under the stars</i>

00:20:39.350 --> 00:20:42.220
<i>I touch you gently</i>

00:20:42.610 --> 00:20:48.090
<i>And we stare into each other's eyes</i>

00:20:48.090 --> 00:20:53.030
<i>Love for you
I hope this touches your heart</i>

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:55.770
Can you see?

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:59.480
She's the Princess and 
she's the one that

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:01.990
saved you and released your 
mother from her sorrow.

00:21:03.980 --> 00:21:11.820
<i>When my heart is freezing, and gets lost</i>

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:18.040
<i>I want to save you,
keeping faith with my heart</i>

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:19.250
Is this...

00:21:19.580 --> 00:21:21.260
The power of the little fox?

00:21:22.000 --> 00:21:25.310
It might be partly so, 
but that's not all...

00:21:25.310 --> 00:21:28.050
<i>I will show you the strong courage
and overwhelming</i>

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:29.390
<i>feeling with my words</i>

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:36.120
<i>I love you, I love you
I hope this touches your heart</i>

00:23:31.890 --> 00:23:32.820
It got stuck!

